  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to convert hermetic compressors at Fresh Compressor Factory to inverter compressor technology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To convert hermetic compressors at Fresh Compressor Factory from HFC-134a to R-600a and introduce inverter compressor technology res ulting in a marginal impact on energy efficiency of approximately 5 per cent from the refrigerant conversion and 30 per cent energy savings from the inverter technology, as well as phasing down 200 mt of HFC-134a annually.</narrative>
  </description>
